<title>BULGARIA: Greek Xiosbank Bulgaria branch back in profit 1996.</title>
<headline>Greek Xiosbank Bulgaria branch back in profit 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sofia branch of Greece's Xiosbank posted 81.81 million lev net profit for 1996 after covering a 22.16 million lev loss for 1995, the bank's balance sheet published in the State Gazette showed.</p>
<p>Xiosbank Sofia branch gross profit for 1996 stood at 103.97 million levs, the bank's profit-and-loss account showed.</p>
<p>Under Bulgarian Accontancy Law local banking insititions, including branches of foreign banks are required to publish their annual balance sheets and profit-and-loss accounts in the State Gazette.</p>
<p>Last year's results follow in million levs unless stated otherwise. Comparative figure for 1995 were not available.</p>
